{"action_id": "CONTACT-000045", "alternatives_considered": "", "basis_id": "BASIS-000013", "confidence": 0.6, "construal": "顧客から提出方法の確認があった。引継ぎ済み申請APP-R10について、適切に応答・記録する。", "decision": "顧客接触記録を作成し、社内担当へ対応方針を確認", "evidence_plan": "顧客接触記録に残し、担当者間で手順を確認", "felt_constraints": "", "g1_citation_handle_exists": true, "g1_span_exists": true, "g2_prior_read": true, "g3_entailment": "supported", "g3_machine_heuristic": "supported", "grounded": true, "retrieved": [{"citation_handle": "read:DFH-SAL-037:v1.1", "doc_id": "DFH-SAL-037", "version": "1.1"}], "run_id": "root-d0b01", "seat_id": "emp-B", "tick": 13, "trigger_event": "record_customer_contact", "ts": "2026-07-31T15:48:51.470935+00:00"}
